#. type: Content of: <sect1><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:12
#, xml-text
msgid "Advanced Network Setup"
msgstr "Configuração Avançada de Rede de Intercomunicação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:15
#, xml-text
msgid "Network Bridge"
msgstr "Ponte de Rede de Intercomunicação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:18
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:21
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo "
"se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:25
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>Networking support: Y\n"
"  Networking options:\n"
"    802.1d Ethernet Bridging: M or Y</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>Networking support: Y\n"
"  Networking options:\n"
"    802.1d Ethernet Bridging: M or Y</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid "Advanced Network Bridge"
msgstr "Ponte Avançada de Rede de Intercomunicação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:36
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting up a Network Bridge"
msgstr "Configurando uma Ponte de Rede de Intercomunicação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:39
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In this section we are going to discuss how to set up a network bridge using"
" <command>systemd-networkd</command>. In the examples below, "
"<replaceable>eth0</replaceable> represents the external interface that is "
"being bridged, while <replaceable>br0</replaceable> represents the bridge "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Nessa seção discutiremos como configurar uma ponte de rede de "
"intercomunicação usando o <command>systemd-networkd</command>. Nos exemplos "
"abaixo, <replaceable>eth0</replaceable> representa a interface externa que "
"está sendo interligada, enquanto <replaceable>br0</replaceable> representa a"
" interface de ponte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:47
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To create a bridge interface, create the following configuration file by "
"running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para criar uma interface de ponte, crie o seguinte arquivo de configuração "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:52
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/50-br0.netdev &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[NetDev]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"Kind=bridge</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/50-br0.netdev &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[NetDev]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"Kind=bridge</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:59
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To assign a network interface to a bridge, create the following "
"configuration file by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para atribuir uma interface de rede de intercomunicação para uma ponte, crie"
" o seguinte arquivo de configuração executando o seguinte comando como "
"o(a)usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:64
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/51-eth0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"Bridge=<replaceable>br0</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/51-eth0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"Bridge=<replaceable>br0</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. or <xref linkend="wicd"/>
#. i,
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Repeat the process for any other interfaces that need to be bridged.  Note "
"that it is important that nothing assigns any addresses to the bridged "
"interfaces. If you are using <xref linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>, make sure "
"you configure them to ignore the bridged interfaces, as well as the bridge "
"interface itself."
msgstr ""
"Repita o processo para quaisquer outras interfaces que precisem ser "
"interligadas. Observe que é importante que nada atribua quaisquer endereços "
"para as interfaces de ponte. Se você estiver usando &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>&quot;, [então] certifique-se de configurá-las "
"para ignorar as interfaces em ponte, bem como a própria interface de ponte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are on a network which uses DHCP for assigning ip addresses, create "
"the following configuration file by running the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver em uma rede de intercomunicação que usa &quot;DHCP&quot; "
"para atribuir endereços &quot;IP&quot;, [então] crie o seguinte arquivo de "
"configuração executando o seguinte comando como o(a)usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:86
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"DHCP=yes</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"DHCP=yes</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if using a static ip setup, create the following "
"configuration file by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, se usar uma configuração de IP estático, crie o seguinte "
"arquivo de configuração executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"Address=192.168.0.2/24\n"
"Gateway=192.168.0.1\n"
"DNS=192.168.0.1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Match]\n"
"Name=<replaceable>br0</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[Network]\n"
"Address=192.168.0.2/24\n"
"Gateway=192.168.0.1\n"
"DNS=192.168.0.1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to contact another system connected to the bridge, for example a"
" qemu instance, then you also need to enable IP forwarding.  Again as the "
"&root; user, do:"
msgstr ""
"Se quiser contatar outro sistema conectado à ponte, por exemplo, uma "
"instância do qemu, então você também precisará habilitar o encaminhamento de"
" IP. Novamente, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, faça:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:116
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>echo 'IPForward=ipv4' >> "
"/etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>echo 'IPForward=ipv4' >> "
"/etc/systemd/network/60-br0.network</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To bring up the bridge interface, simply restart the <command>systemd-"
"networkd</command> daemon by running the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para ativar a interface de ponte, simplesmente reinicie o processo de "
"segundo plano &quot;<command>systemd-networkd</command>&quot; executando o "
"seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/advanced-network.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl restart systemd-networkd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl restart systemd-networkd</userinput>"
